WEBVTT

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:24.290
This way!

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:24.950
What's wrong?!

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:26.680
It's over by the lighthouse!

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:31.360
Hurry! A wrecked ship drifted ashore!

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:51.370
This is bad...

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:21.780
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:25.750
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:28.250
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:32.750
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:38.560
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:42.500
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:50.610
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:57.910
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:03.450
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:10.590
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:16.060
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:18.500
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:25.440
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:27.710
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:31.780
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:34.280
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:38.820
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:44.630
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:47.530
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:05.650
We're going so fast!

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:07.640
It's splitting the waves right in half!

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:12.450
Oh! Look, look!
Something just jumped!

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:13.980
Careful!

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:18.490
Sit down, will you?

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:24.330
<i>I'm glad I dragged her</i> <i>here to Alberta.</i>

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:28.040
<i>She seems to have</i> <i>forgotten about Keough.</i>

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:33.670
They say Alberta is crawling with monsters. How exciting.

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:39.180
What's wrong? Are you seasick?

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:42.120
Don't bother me. I'm fine.

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:43.180
Huh?

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:47.350
Alberta is in sight!

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.190
Wow!

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:54.030
It's beautiful!

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.870
Poring!

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:22.490
Hah? Where... are the monsters?

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:24.480
Hmph. This is stupid.

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:27.150
Hu-uh?

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.340
Hey! Mister...

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:36.170
Where're all the monsters?

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:38.410
Aren't they supposed to be everywhere?

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:43.580
Yes, Alberta is full of monsters. Look.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:44.880
Huh?

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:47.950
...7, 8, 9, 10...

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:49.880
Are you ready now?

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:52.350
Yes, we are.

00:04:58.390 --> 00:04:59.790
Caught you!

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:01.130
Hey!

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:13.140
At first, everyone panicked, but now they're used to them.

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:16.630
Not the kind of monsters you'd kill, anyway.

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:24.550
What the hell was that?!

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:27.920
The great monster invasion was all a lie!

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:30.690
This is so stupid!

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:32.260
It's ridiculous!

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:37.470
Now, now. The monsters did really appear in great numbers.

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:41.500
Huh? Yes, but...

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:44.170
Since we're already here at a South Seas island,

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:46.870
let's think of more pleasant things.

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:52.810
Hmm. You're right.
This sun, the blue sea and sky...

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:55.750
It makes me feel like swimming naked.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:57.320
Naked?!

00:05:57.320 --> 00:06:00.590
Yes, it sounds wonderful.

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.280
Not you, too, Yuufa?!

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:09.960
<i>Roan!</i>

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:13.670
<i>Over here!</i>

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:16.640
<i>Big brother!</i>

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.340
<i>Hurry over here!</i>

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:23.140
<i>Oh, my bikini is too tight.</i>
<i>I'm taking it off.</i>

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:24.210
<i>Then I will, too.</i>

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:25.550
<i>Ma-chan will too!</i>

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:27.950
<i>I shall, too.</i>

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:29.820
<i>There!</i>

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:37.990
Roan, what's wrong?

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:41.660
His imagination was probably running away with him.

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:44.600
Takius-<i>san</i>?

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:48.800
Excuse me. I sensed an evil aura.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.000
I'm going outside for some fresh air.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:59.180
Huh?

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:00.680
Ow...

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:05.150
Well, well. Here's a familiar face.

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.280
Huh?

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:13.730
Welcome home.

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:18.470
I didn't come back because
I wanted to, especially...

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:21.570
Old man, do you know Maaya?

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:28.640
Of course. She grew up in this town.

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:30.480
Is that so?!

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:37.150
Then you should've said so!

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:42.480
Keep quiet! Leave me alone!

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.900
Maybe she can't help it.

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:59.670
Her memories of this town might be too painful.

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:10.990
Poring...

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:14.260
<i>Now we're open for business.</i>

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:18.630
<i>Stop it! Stop it! Stop it!</i>

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:26.730
Oh, I'm so thirsty.

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:30.170
M-Miss Temperast, please...

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.300
Oh, thank you.

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:36.140
Ahh. Simply delicious.

00:08:37.210 --> 00:08:39.150
Yahoo!

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:47.490
What's this?! Oh, no! My hair!

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:59.570
Maybe I shouldn't have come back, after all.

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:01.760
Poring...

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:07.000
It's been cleaned?

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:13.910
Hah. We came all the way to Alberta

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:18.050
because we heard of the massive monster outbreak.

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:22.850
But those piddly monsters are barely enough to fill our bellies.

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:27.350
Will you satisfy our hunger for us?

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:33.090
Get her!

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:34.560
Stop!

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:35.800
Huh?!

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:38.200
Cart...

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:40.360
Revolution!

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:43.690
What the heck?!

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:47.370
Hmph!

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:56.880
Are you the one who cleaned this warehouse?

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:03.090
You're-

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:11.870
What's with that violent merchant?!

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:13.900
Why would she save a monster?!

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.470
She'll pay!

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:18.340
Violent merchant?

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:26.810
You...

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:31.690
Are... you all alone?

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:34.020
I am, too.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.020
Poring.

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:45.430
Alice...

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.530
Alice?

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:52.910
I'm Maaya. Maaya.

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:54.710
Maa... ya?

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:56.370
Right.

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:49.500
I wonder where Maaya-<i>chan</i> is?

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:51.270
Shall I look for her?

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:55.030
Never mind. She'll come back when she's hungry.

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:03.680
Sorry! Ma-<i>chan</i> is late!

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:06.810
Wow! What a feast!

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:08.980
Down the hatch!

00:13:13.050 --> 00:13:15.890
Oh, this is good! Mm!

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:17.320
So is this...

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:20.560
--Excuse me, everyone.
--Ah, delicious.

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:22.660
I must speak to you.

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:29.670
There is one among us who befriends a monster.

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.810
A monster?

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:36.680
What do you mean by that?

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:41.280
Monsters are evil creatures.
They should be destroyed.

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:46.080
However, to befriend one, instead, is most foolish...

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:49.490
You followed me?!

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:50.990
I did not do that.

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:52.090
Liar!

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:54.200
Humans are always like that!

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:56.660
They're sneaks! And cheats!

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:59.430
And never think of how others feel!

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:03.500
Poi-poi and Alice are much better...

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.630
...than humans!

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:10.480
P-Poring!

00:14:10.480 --> 00:14:13.380
What the heck was that all about?

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:15.370
Takius-<i>san</i>?!

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:58.020
Poring... poring... poring... poring.

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:18.310
How do you know that song?

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:34.650
Thank you.

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:39.870
I was the only survivor on a wrecked ship...

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:42.340
...that drifted into this town's harbor.

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:53.150
And I lived all on my own in this town.

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:57.020
I'm cold... I'm hungry...

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:02.620
Thank you, Poi-poi.

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:14.600
Look, Poi-poi.

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:19.470
I'm going to sell all these apples you brought.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.080
Poring!

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:25.640
All right! Now we're in business!

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:32.990
Apples! Buy an apple!

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:40.130
Apples! Delicious apples! Buy an apple!

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:44.370
Apples! Buy an apple!

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:48.670
Apples! They're very delicious!
Delicious apples!

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:55.280
Hey, who gave you permission to sell apples?

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.140
Huh?

00:16:56.140 --> 00:16:59.280
You ain't a member of the merchants' guild!

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:04.450
You can't be doing things... like this!

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:07.290
Stop it!

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:12.060
Poring!

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:16.290
Help! Somebody, help me!

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:23.470
C'mere, you!

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:26.410
No! Stop it!

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:30.970
Stop it! Stop it, stop it!

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:50.760
Poring.

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:52.490
Poi-poi...

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:56.840
Poring!

00:17:56.840 --> 00:18:00.040
That's when I learned...

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:03.740
that humans are the lowest creatures on earth.

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:07.210
They're not worthy of my trust.

00:18:07.210 --> 00:18:09.620
After that, I...

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:16.620
Anyhow, I did anything I had to, to survive.

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:27.630
Are you comforting me?

00:18:44.650 --> 00:18:46.810
This song...

00:18:48.590 --> 00:18:49.720
Poring!

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:07.310
A heart steeped in sentimentality.

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:10.010
Utter folly.

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:12.950
What are you doing?

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:18.120
Is this your work?

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:22.590
The greater your expectations, the greater the disappointment.

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:25.960
Believe, and someday you will be betrayed.

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:29.030
If so, expect nothing from the start.

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:31.230
Believe in nothing.

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:34.800
I... have no expectations!

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:38.290
Has Baphomet buried your heart?

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:47.150
Jirtas, this mask reveals all that you are.

00:19:47.150 --> 00:19:49.920
Your half-existence.

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:53.050
Your soul... and even your mission.

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:54.320
Why you-

00:20:19.350 --> 00:20:22.080
Wha-

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:24.450
Yo! Thug Merchant!

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:26.890
This is payback for yesterday.

00:20:26.890 --> 00:20:31.020
You dare embarrass me like that?

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:31.860
Get them!

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:33.020
Poring!

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:36.700
Alice-<i>chan</i>! Hurry!

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:41.200
What're you doing?!

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:43.030
Don't let them get away!

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:49.370
You messed us up good yesterday!

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:53.040
Alice-<i>chan</i>! Hurry!

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:07.330
No way!!

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.740
Quit running!

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:16.070
Frost...

00:21:16.070 --> 00:21:19.370
Stop it!!

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:21.170
...Diver!

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:38.830
You... why?

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:42.960
At times, human hearts are controlled by the dark.

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:48.100
However, not all humans are so. And...

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:53.040
It is humans who are also able to rectify their mistakes.

00:21:55.340 --> 00:21:58.040
I wished for you to know that.

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:16.030
Huh?

00:22:16.030 --> 00:22:18.970
Are you giving this to me?

00:22:18.970 --> 00:22:20.660
Thank you!

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:32.140 --> 00:23:36.980
<i>This is Riporte.</i>
<i>Oh, time to go, already?</i>

00:23:36.980 --> 00:23:40.650
<i>Next, "Life Is Precious.</i>
<i>Unfortunate Are They Who Do Not Know."</i>

00:23:40.650 --> 00:23:44.350
<i>Until we meet again...</i>
